# Witness for ClaimWriteMeetsRoutingClaim. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - a re-presented claim of S - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: ClaimWriteMeetsRoutingClaimWitness
TARGET: ClaimWriteMeetsRoutingClaim
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a re-presented claim of S is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
        /\ broken' = broken \cup Fails("ClaimWriteMeetsRoutingClaim",
                                         i # "S" \/ ClaimAdmits("S", [j \in Inits |-> s], retired, fence))
--- REPLACE
        /\ broken' = broken \cup Fails("ClaimWriteMeetsRoutingClaim", i # "S")
--- END
